# This directory is generated by MuchAdo during build so AI agents can discover the bundled skill.
# Keep this .gitignore checked in so the generated skill files stay out of source control
# and updates to MuchAdo don't cause unnecessary changes to your repository.
# To disable generation, set <EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>false</EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills> in your project or Directory.Build.props.
*
!.gitignore
